Jade (Horizon)
==============

A Horizon mod (WebAssembly, mod API 0.2) by ameliiom.

It is an adaptation of earlier works, credited as their licence requires:

  Jade, by Snownee and contributors
    https://github.com/Snownee/Jade
  jade-horizon, a Horizon port of Jade, by Pierddev
    https://github.com/Pierddev/jade-horizon

Both are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
International (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/). This mod was modified
from them (Arabic translation, right-to-left layout, newer Horizon build and the other changes
in the Git history) and is shared under the same licence. See the LICENSE file.

No Minecraft or Mojang assets or data are included; block and item icons and names are read
at runtime from the player's own game. Not affiliated with Snownee, Pierddev or the Horizon
project.
